# No line-ending conversion: every file is checked out byte for byte as committed, on every
# platform. Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true by default) would otherwise check out LF files
# as CRLF, and the SHA-256 checks of folders 01-03 and of reproduction/results would fail.
* -text
# Shell scripts are committed and checked out with LF, also when edited on Windows.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.pkl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
